      "source": "A customizer for a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/servlet/setup/ConfigurableMockMvcBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet.setup\"><code>ConfigurableMockMvcBuilder</code></a>. Any\n<code>MockMvcBuilderCustomizer</code> beans found in the application context will be\n<a href=\"#customize(org.springframework.test.web.servlet.setup.ConfigurableMockMvcBuilder)\"><code>called</code></a> to customize the auto-configured <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/servlet/MockMvcBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.servlet\"><code>MockMvcBuilder</code></a>.",
